 ry Nov 10 paper registration gates paper submission: no new submissions a
 nd no author additions or removals after it. OpenReview's public submissi
 on invitation\, open to all users since Oct 27 and due Nov 10 AoE\, was l
 ive on 2026-10-30. XXL is supported by the organizer's description of mor
 e than 10\,000 annual attendees. Historical acceptance statistics refer t
 o the main technical program\, not workshops.
